# Supporting Tooling

To support maintenance and continuous improvement of the Decision Standardization Framework, several analytical tools were developed.

Examples include:

- Keyword and Phrase Extraction
- Anchor-Driven Phrase Expansion
- Heatmap-Based Signal Analysis
- Audit Sampling Calculators
- Confidence Assessment Templates

These tools support refinement of the Signal Interpretation Layer but are not required for operation of the framework itself.
